{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0294_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "513dfaf62e1b85fae9a9ff221ba9273b3ea531a3bc07dfa81e817416071a184d", "ja": "再起動─リブート─", "zh": "重启─Reboot─", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0294_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "13fe2f853c8757f2897fa8e21c3b28982c3676511dbba7f51d37e25520fa852e", "ja": "志保、瑞希、紬の3人がアンドロイドを演じ\nるユニット『EScape』のファンイベント\nが開催決定！　再起動したアンドロイド達\nは、自分達の置かれている状況を把握する\nため、記憶領域の走査を開始する……。", "zh": "志保、瑞希、紬3人饰演仿生人的\n组合“EScape”确定举办粉丝活动！\n重启后的仿生人们为了掌握自身所处的\n状况，开始扫描记忆领域……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0294_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_01_1000_null", "source_sha256": "aa801d1d844e7e7182be4cc64d0d084a1edce9f8dfb435dcbafde065b22ba356", "ja": "……………………………………ピピッ。", "zh": "………………………………哔哔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0294_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_01_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "4b8e4c2cf9737fc9da15257d3222e996c327e14e6c64a3eb80cb4542aa59528d", "ja": "アンドロイド識別番号コード44、\n再起動シークエンスに入ります。", "zh": "安卓识别编号代码44，\n进入重启程序。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0294_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_01_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5e20f4198fd17bead1da171d6a2a731b6702f8358a5bb7300e4803d9a3433bee", "ja": "アンドロイド識別番号コード51、\n再起動シークエンスに入ります。", "zh": "安卓识别编号代码51，进入重启程序。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0294_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_01_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "4975c89e8aee5c533e42ac59b5f917e57d268ad405efc3aa49c9a6400285ce45", "ja": "アンドロイド識別番号コード33、\n再起動シークエンスに入ります。", "zh": "安卓识别编号代码33，\n进入重启程序。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0294_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_01_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "804e3c4872208a0cd6ab3fff83398cd3dec259ef8184bc238607fc84c1ab0012", "ja": "記憶領域へアクセス……成功。データ破損率軽微、\n少し早とちり程度。動作に影響なしと判断。", "zh": "访问记忆区域……成功。数据损坏率轻微，仅有少许判断过于仓促。判定对运行无影响。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0294_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_01_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "7d8ee7f09281636dbbf0589fb4ddb7c24fccfb8e68732e1bcac3fc80c92202aa", "ja": "マニピュレータチェック開始。駆動系正常。\n料理から手品の各種ソフト、インストール確認。", "zh": "开始检查机械臂。驱动系统正常。\n确认已安装从料理到魔术的各种软件。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0294_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_01_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "261f9b856416fde9704eb58bc5371d86e1e81ba423cd2f1405defc1544139279", "ja": "外部からの情報を知覚、認識に問題なし。\n再起動シークエンス、完了……。", "zh": "外部信息感知、认知功能正常。\n重启程序，完成……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0294_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_01_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "bcfb7a8fd3ea11a532626a01f79d8cc44c3ad06ee945532b96a55bad9b19805c", "ja": "どうやら、無事に再起動が完了したようです。\nここは……どこかの研究所でしょうか？", "zh": "看来已经顺利完成重启了。这里……是什么研究所吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0294_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_01_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "e290b6b05b110303b26918f5d3545ab0008ef1cdf7c12a34d9d6a6d709875958", "ja": "視覚情報から推察するに、違うのではないかと。\nシホ、記憶領域から検索を……。", "zh": "根据视觉信息推测，应该不是。千早，请从记忆区域搜索……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0294_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_01_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "5763e34fc1d9eb267b81a3875ec1b0e2b4f0f53931b0a255f194111ee7b56352", "ja": "もうやってるわ。タグも座標も存在しない、\n私たちにとっては未知の場所みたい。……？", "zh": "我已经在查了。标签和坐标都不存在，看来是对我们来说未知的地方。……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0294_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_01_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "c4d18ac6e698234fc18362b736af856e72e509fb42dad9f3fc902ff167db04ea", "ja": "どうかしましたか、シホ？", "zh": "怎么了，志保？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0294_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_01_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "7a9449859571c5f7ba1d197b527dc98b8f54cfc6acef1e6256b89638d6599f56", "ja": "シホ……。\nなぜ私は、その言葉に返事を……？", "zh": "志保……\n我为什么会对那句话做出回应……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0294_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_01_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "471a6b8b61cd4d8432ed3e4c81247f0c444bdec0cef1171b19d76a1621d32266", "ja": "それが、あなたの名前だからです。\n私の名前は……そう、ミズキ。", "zh": "因为那是你的名字。\n我的名字是……对，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0294_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_01_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "4f74411e1ff93bcd62acf2fbb8f4e7e705524759849e9932a7f1ac4853c62716", "ja": "確かに、記憶領域にデータが確認できる。\n識別番号とは別の……あなたの名前は、ツムギね？", "zh": "确实，在记忆区域中可以确认到这份数据。\n与识别编号不同的……你的名字，是纺吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0294_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_01_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7a887a927b47ffcb0b87afe29ccfc08818aafe60e76d85679d25a6dbb113ff0e", "ja": "ええ、私はツムギです。\nあの人からもらった、大切な名前……。", "zh": "嗯，我就是紬。\n这是那个人送给我的、珍贵的名字……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0294_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_01_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "df75bea85d171d0f99720163d9ad18d33f7b15749567fb45ced239f5529920ce", "ja": "あの人……。", "zh": "那个人……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0294_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_01_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c1753ee94e8a989eb8d517256462eb0138bdf1c6686f37afceec43929ef288ca", "ja": "記憶領域に該当する情報が残っています。\n断片的ではありますが……。", "zh": "记忆区域中留有相关信息。虽然是零散的片段……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0294_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_01_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "4edb7ce05b71cfdb81c369417e07f83d6fb0672faae0d8f2d26828beb416876c", "ja": "我々の中に残る断片を集めれば情報を補完……\nいいえ、思い出せるはず。", "zh": "只要收集我们记忆中残留的片段，就能补全信息……\n不，我应该能想起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0294_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_01_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "b74b8b48320efae00b165b69658314f656030de492abb80a91e59cc64f0d8fe0", "ja": "ええ、そうね。早速全員のデータを集めて、\n再生してみましょう。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。马上收集所有人的数据，试着恢复看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
